- λz : régression sur {{call_2.lambda_z.n_points}} points ({{call_2.lambda_z.time_first}} h → {{call_2.lambda_z.time_last}} h), R² = {{call_2.lambda_z.r_squared}}, R² ajusté = {{call_2.lambda_z.adj_r_squared}}
